tamiji prije otprilike 5000 godina. <br/><br/>Istočne verzije abaka, kineski &quot;suànpán&quot; i japanski &quot;soroban&quot; bili su u masovnoj upotrebi sve do kraja 20. stoljeća kada su ih istisnuli digitalni džepni kalkulatori, dok su Europljani već potkraj 17. stoljeća abak zamijenili drugim uređajima kao što je logaritamsko računalo.</div><div class="qr-and-instructions"><div class="qr-container"><img src="/assets/images/final/image.png" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="desktop" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/abak-20comp.png" data-src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 47vw" alt="Abak - antički kalkulator" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/abak-20comp-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/abak-20comp.png 700w" class="heroheader05_image hero-image-size"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" data-src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background image-background-opacity"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/ar-20ikona-20-20s.png" data-src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div><div class="copyright-or-caption"><div class="text-block-8">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/image.png" data-src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/wilhelm-20i-20mehanic-cc-8cki-20kalkulator.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/wilhelm-20i-20mehanic-cc-8cki-20kalkulator-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/wilhelm-20i-20mehanic-cc-8cki-20kalkulator.png 527w" alt="Wilhelm i mehanicÌŒki kalkulator" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_9775fcd1-f84c-b594-da3c-5dcdbadd7a3e-f78de882" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Prvi mehanički kalkulator<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/wilhelm-20i-20mehanic-cc-8cki-20kalkulator.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/wilhelm-20i-20mehanic-cc-8cki-20kalkulator-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/wilhelm-20i-20mehanic-cc-8cki-20kalkulator.png 527w" alt="Wilhelm i mehanicÌŒki kalkulator" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 100vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Iako to priznanje nije doživio za svog života Nijemac Wilhelm Schickard 1623. godine konstruirao je prvi mehanički kalkulator.<br/><br/>Javnost za to nije znala jer je jedini primjerak kalkulatora progutao požar neposredno prije dovršenja.<br/><br/>Stotinjak godina kasnije otkrivena su pisma koja je Schickard slao kolegi znanstveniku Johannesu Kepleru s nacrtima po kojima je tek 1960. napravljen funkcionalan kalkulator, čime je dokazano da era mehaničkih kalkulatora počinje s Wilhelmom Schickardom.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_8a5a6187-4d73-4879-6ef0-b1fb10cad645-f78de882" class="layout58_content mobile-view-image"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Pascalina<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/pascaline.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/pascaline-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/pascaline.png 526w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 100vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Tada devetnaestogodišnji Blaise Pascal, kasnije poznat po Pascalovom zakonu hidrodinamike, ne bi li olakšao rad svom ocu porezniku, izradio je 1642. godine mehanički kalkulator &quot;Pascalinu&quot;.<br/><br/>ĐŒak je 1649. dobio kraljevsku povlasticu koja mu je jamčila ekskluzivno pravo prodaje kalkulatora u Francuskoj, no u tri godine prodao ih je tek petnaestak. Zbog nedostataka tadašnje tehnologije, &quot;Pascalina&quot; nije bila baš sasvim precizna u svojim izračunima.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/pascaline.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/pascaline-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/pascaline.png 526w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/leibnitz-20i-20valjci-20za-20rac-cc-8cunanje-2.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/leibnitz-20i-20valjci-20za-20rac-cc-8cunanje-2-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/leibnitz-20i-20valjci-20za-20rac-cc-8cunanje-2.png 526w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_26d03770-e437-fa88-4b8a-7c9f92e3f155-f78de882" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Valjci za računanje<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/pozadina-20za-20sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left"/><img src="/assets/images/final/leibnitz-20i-20valjci-20za-20rac-cc-8cunanje-2.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/leibnitz-20i-20valjci-20za-20rac-cc-8cunanje-2-p-500.png 500w, /assets/images/final/leibnitz-20i-20valjci-20za-20rac-cc-8cunanje-2.png 526w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 69vw, 100vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Nijemac Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz bio je filozof, matematičar, fizičar i diplomat. U svijetu kalkulatora ostao je zapamćen jer je 1673. izumio stupnjevani valjak, nazivan i Leibnizov kotač, a 1685. ozubljeni valjak.<br/><br/>Oba izuma su značajno unaprijedila rad strojeva za računanje, a principi koje je Leibniz ustanovio još su stoljećima bili temelj izrade mehaničkih kalkulatora.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>